  "content": {
    "equation": "Bolus Dose:\nWhen Bolus Dose = “Yes”:\nBolus Dose (mL) = (Weight * Bolus Dose) / Concentration\n• Bolus Dose (mL) is calculated in mL\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Bolus Dose is input in mcg/kg\n• Concentration is input in mcg/mL\nInfusion Rate:\nIf Concentration = anything except “Other”:\nIf Concentration = anything except “Other”:\nInfusion Rate = (Infusion Dose * Weight) / Concentration\n• Infusion Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Infusion Dose is input in mcg/kg/hour\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Concentration is input in mcg/mL\nIf Concentration = “Other”:\nInfusion Rate = (Infusion Dose * Weight) / (Drug Amount / Infusate Volume)\n• Infusion Rate is calculated in mL/hour\n• Infusion Dose is input in mcg/kg/hour\n• Weight is input in kg\n• Drug Amount is input in mcg\n• Infusate Volume is input in mL",
